          "type": "reasoning",
          "text": "We need to compute eta radiative correction at given kinematics: W=1.6 GeV, Q2=1.0 GeV^2, cos theta*=0.5, phi*=90 deg, standard CLAS12 settings.\n\nWe need to generate EXCLURAD input files. First, we need to understand the channel: eta electroproduction. Use exclurad_list_channels to see available channels. Then use preflight check for the point. Then generate input.\n\nLet's start by listing channels.",
